          "text": "“Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Naadaunia atukonokin ekek loka Isirael kotoma otuŋa kama isiarakina, ketalaun kamakec kakonyen nuka atekerin, kosodete iboikinos akwapukec nakainakinit ekabulesit Yakob. ",
